        {
          "page": 1,
          "section": "Abstract",
          "quote": "In this study, we examine the effects of lattice distortion on the mechanical properties of Nb-Ti-V-Zr MEAs, focusing on two alloy series: Nb(Ti1.5V)xZr and Nb(TiV)xZr (x = 1, 2, 3, 4 and 5).",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "1df08870cd227df5:part:001"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "alloy_system_2",
      "name": "Nb(Ti1.5V)xZr medium-entropy alloy",
      "material_category": "refractory medium-entropy alloy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 3,
          "section": "3.1. Alloy Design",
          "quote": "we systematically designed two series of refractory medium-entropy alloys with the general formulas Nb(TiV)xZr and Nb(Ti1.5V)xZr (where x = 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5). In these alloy systems, (TiV) denotes a 1:1 atomic ratio of Ti and V, while (Ti1.5V) represents a ratio of Ti:V = 1.5:1.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
          "chunk_id": "1df08870cd227df5:part:001"
        }
      ]
    }
